  "summary": "Experienced Embedded Software Engineer with 8+ years of industry experience at L3Harris, specializing in Linux kernel development, custom board bring-up, and low-level hardware interfacing. Proven ability to design and maintain Linux drivers, develop robust embedded solutions, and debug complex systems. Expertise includes Device Tree authoring, U-Boot customization, and protocol-level communication (I2C, SPI, UART). Strong background in C/C++ development, embedded Linux debugging, and cross-functional collaboration with hardware and manufacturing teams. Holds a B.S. in Computer Engineering from Florida International University.",
